Error: case_when() Missing TRUE


Problem


Show the code
bp_clean |&gt; 
  mutate(
    age_cat = case_when(
      age &lt; 40 ~ "Young",
      age &gt;= 60 ~ "Senior"
    )
  ) |&gt; 
  select(age, age_cat)


#&gt; # A tibble: 200 × 2
#&gt;      age age_cat
#&gt;    &lt;dbl&gt; &lt;chr&gt;  
#&gt;  1    36 Young  
#&gt;  2    79 Senior 
#&gt;  3    19 Young  
#&gt;  4    70 Senior 
#&gt;  5    61 Senior 
#&gt;  6    43 &lt;NA&gt;   
#&gt;  7    49 &lt;NA&gt;   
#&gt;  8    23 Young  
#&gt;  9    49 &lt;NA&gt;   
#&gt; 10    72 Senior 
#&gt; # ℹ 190 more rows



Solution


Show the code
bp_clean |&gt; 
  mutate(
    age_cat = case_when(
      age &lt; 40 ~ "Young",
      age &gt;= 60 ~ "Senior",
      TRUE ~ "Middle"
    )
  )

