gtsummary Tables in Quarto
gtsummary integrates naturally with Quarto. Use as_kable_extra() or the default print() method for HTML output; use as_gt() for PDF.



Table 1: Baseline characteristics by intervention group.


library(gtsummary)

overall_up |&gt;
  select(current_age, sex, tobacco_type, fuel_type, sbp_0m, intervention) |&gt;
  tbl_summary(
    by      = intervention,
    missing = "no"
  ) |&gt;
  add_p() |&gt;
  add_overall() |&gt;
  bold_labels()



Adjusting output by format:

tbl &lt;- overall_up |&gt;
  tbl_summary(by = intervention)

# HTML output
tbl

# For PDF (via gt)
tbl |&gt; as_gt()

# For Word
tbl |&gt; as_flex_table()
